<title>FRANCE: Cegelec signs Indonesian tram agreement.</title>
<headline>Cegelec signs Indonesian tram agreement.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom unit Cegelec said on Friday it had signed an agreement with Indonesian railway company Perumka on the joint development of the Bandung tram system.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the first phase of this project will cost an estimated 1.5 billion francs but it gave no details about what Cegelec's role in the project would be.</p>
<p>Cegelec was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
